<title>DUBAI: Abu Dhabi LNG output in August hits record - ADGAS.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi LNG output in August hits record - ADGAS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi Gas Liquefaction Co Ltd (ADGAS) produced a record 734,390 tonnes of liquefied natural gas (LNG) in August, the company said in its monthy magazine.</p>
<p>ADGAS's main LNG customer is Tokyo Electric Power Co (TEPCO), which lifted 4.5 million tonnes from April to March 1997.</p>
<p>Total LNG output reached more than 5.3 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>Propane output in August totalled 83,418 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
